@program gtk3-text-input-test
@compositor sway
@conf hime-input-style=2
@conf hime-root-x=100
@conf hime-root-y=400
@conf hime-pop-up-win=1
@env HIME_CHECK_BACKGROUND=1000,700
# The same pronunciation query of gtab (` then a character's keys): the
# Zhuyin window lists the characters below gtab's window, also when the
# Zhuyin method was never used (it showed nothing); 1 picks the first.
` a <space> @exec popup-shot.sh:300,455:600,600 1
